                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.4310/SDG.2010.v15.n1.a4"} doi:10.4310/SDG.2010.v15.n1.a4
          %p
            See at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifold"} orientifold
            for more on this; also at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/discrete+torsion"} discrete torsion
          %p
            The role of the KR field in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+K-theory"} twisted K-theory
            (see
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K-theory+classification+of+D-brane+charge"} K-theory classification of D-brane charge
          %ul
            %li#Moore
